Package: patrone-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Recommends: patrone-gnome-taskbar, fonts-patrone-sans
Description: Patrone's own settings: taskbar, desktop, theme, mouse pointer
 Patrone Settings has the settings Patrone adds to the desktop's own: the
 taskbar's size (small, medium or large) and layout, the desktop bubble,
 which corner of windows' title bars minimize, maximize and close go in,
 the theme, one of five looks for the taskbar, title bars and window
 buttons, the desktop's font, Patrone Sans or Noto Sans, and the mouse
 pointer's theme and size. Each choice shows a picture of what it does.
